3"}, "display_name": "Zion Combat: Stand Against the Dark", "keywords": ["fighting", "faith", "scripture", "handtracking", "arena"], "long_description": "- **Stand.** Meet a blow with your raised forearm at the right moment and turn it back in a burst of gold.\n- **Your body is the controller.** Punch, and light flies to the one you aim at. Thrust an open palm to Repel, clap for a Thunderclap, point to Rebuke, slash for the Sword of the Spirit. Cross your arms and fling them open for Breakthrough, roll your fists to Bind, hold a ball of light and thrust a Zoe Blast, crouch and Arise.\n- **Refill the way believers do.** Pray to refill your Spirit, lift your hands in surrender for Glory and Life, and touch the Book on your wrist to Eat the Word while it heals you.\n- **Seven champions,** each with their own powers and an ultimate: altar fire, claimed ground, written words, seven thunders, seals, the watchman's lamps and threads of prayer.\n- **30 Battles in three great halls,** three bosses, Endless Watch, a Daily Watch, Boss Challenges and a pass-the-headset Church Event.\n- **Learn the moves:** a guided course traces every movement in light. The Command List shows them for hands and for controllers.\n- **Scripture as power.** Declare verses in the fight. Every verse is kept in the Book to read in context.\n- **Comfortable by design:** you only move when you choose to, with a short blink between rings of light. Seated or standing, snap turning, calmer flashes, subtitles.\n- Original characters. King James Version scripture. Voices are computer-generated for now; recorded voices come in a free update.", "short_description": "Raise your forearm as the darkness strikes and Stand: a bell rings, gold light bursts from your arm, and the shadow is thrown back. Zion Combat is a hands-first arena brawler where seven champions of faith fight the Veil with their own bodies: punches that fly as light, open-palm thrusts, claps of thunder, a pointed Rebuke and the spoken Word. No gore: darkness dissolves into light. Seated or standing, hands or controllers."}]}, "developer_name": "SaneBits", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sanebits.com/products/zion-combat/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SaneBits", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sanebits.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1428774519431583"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2252059208703594"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2252059208703594"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1794315360, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2252059208703594"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1429561239352911", "version": "1.0.0"}, "id": "1118546127563060", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1428774516098250", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1429561239352911"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "111854612